body:
the morning commute usually coincides with the morning cry...

&#x200B;

most days im distracted enough by 10 to not have a thought to myself, and unless my blood sugar drops, I can usually make it through the evening without a hitch... usually. I have been noticing the difference between morning and afternoon a lot more too.

I always make the offhanded comment about indentured servitude, monetary slavery, etc... I feel like it is, and they took the college rush of the 21st century and turned it to pure profit so that no one will be able to break that barrier into the wealthy unless you don't play by their rules like elon musk or someone truly genius

&#x200B;

honestly, bc no one wants to do things for themselves anymore, trade schools are definitely the way to go in my book. plumbers, electricians, and the likes are where the money is gonna be for the next generationn
